sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Runner as Agents SDK Runner
    participant Model as MiniMax-M3
    participant Guard as Protocol Guard
    participant Tools as ReadingCorpusTools
    participant Corpus as Java Corpus API
    participant State as Run-local State

    Note over Runner,State: One request-local Agent, Context, Session, and bounded RunControl
    loop Until an accepted submission or terminal limit
        Runner->>Model: model request<br/>tool_choice=required
        Model-->>Runner: one or more Function Tool calls
        Runner->>Guard: validate requested action
        alt research or catalog tool allowed
            Guard-->>Runner: accepted action
            Runner->>Tools: execute serially<br/>max_function_tool_concurrency=1
            Tools->>Corpus: search / structure / exact read
            Corpus-->>Tools: candidates / locations / Source Quotes
            Tools->>State: record disclosed paper, location, Source Quote
            Tools-->>Runner: structured tool result
            Runner->>Model: append tool result and continue
        else submission requested
            Guard->>State: check contract, format, known Source Quotes, block citations
            alt missing research input
                Guard-->>Runner: ACTIVE + allowed research tools
                Runner->>Model: rejection details<br/>continue research
            else repairable submission error
                Guard-->>Runner: REPAIR + same submit tool only
                Runner->>Model: validation issues<br/>repair submission
            else accepted submission
                Guard-->>Runner: COMPLETE + accepted draft
                Runner-->>Runner: tools_to_final_output ends Run
            end
        else action forbidden
            Guard-->>Runner: protocol error + allowed actions
            Runner->>Model: structured correction
        end
    end
    Runner-->>Runner: ProductTurnResult
